<title>BULGARIA: No aircraft land in Sofia airport due to dense fog.</title>
<headline>No aircraft land in Sofia airport due to dense fog.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A dense fog prevented commercial aircraft from landing at Sofia airport on Monday morning and incoming flights were diverted, an airport official said.</p>
<p>&quot;Incoming international flights from Rome, Bucharest, Kiev, and Balkan Airlines flights from Tel Aviv, Frankfurt, Istanbul, Ohrid might be diverted to (the Black Sea port of) Bourgas,&quot; said the official.</p>
<p>However, a flight to Zurich began on schedule at 1000 hours local time (0800 GMT), the official said.</p>
